<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY TO SELL 81.31 PCT STAKE IN HUNGAROCAMION.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY TO SELL 81.31 PCT STAKE IN HUNGAROCAMION.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian privatisation agency APV Rt said on Wednesday it will announce a one-round, open tender for the sale of a 81.31 percent stake worth 4.26 billion forints in transport company Hungarocamion Rt.</p>
<p>&quot;The successful bidder will have to increase the company's capital by at least 1.3 billion forints within 75 days from the sale,&quot; APV said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added that APV will offer a 10 percent stake -- worth 523 million forints -- to employees once the sale has been completed.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
